-lc100-2019-0.1deg","hash":"sha256:777678b4d6e4bae78f451737b034fda34cd1565f602f15acecc5e8ad1bf7de13"},{"id":"open occurrence records (content/intelligence/range-habitat/inputs/wild-boar.records.json)","hash":"sha256:5ac8c9653ab8488efab5018c72cce47f1399184b229d0f72b378fb62a6d29081"}],"literature":["Extreme habitat generalist: forests, swamps, brushlands, grasslands and farmland, preferring to stay near water. — North Ground's published profile of the species, citing Minnesota Department of Natural Resources, European wild boar / Eurasian swine (Sus scrofa scrofa); U.S. National Invasive Species Information Center (USDA), Wild Boar; North Carolina Wildlife Resources Commission, Feral Swine."],"reading":"A generalist: forest, swamp, brush, grassland and farmland are all strong and none is singled out — and nearness to water or wetland decides how strong (it prefers to stay near water).","profile":{"family":"BIG_GAME","reachKm":50,"landCover":{"HIGH":["ALL_FOREST","WETLAND","SHRUB","HERBACEOUS","CROPLAND"]},"edge":null,"requires":[{"feature":"WATER_OR_WETLAND","thresholds":{"CORE":0.04,"HIGH":0.015,"MODERATE":0.005,"LOW":0}}],"coastKm":null,"season":null,"whyNotRangeHabitat":null},"range":{"confirmedSquares":108,"countedSquares":89,"islandSquares":0,"openRecords":1814,"datasets":20,"months":null},"cells":{"painted":10828,"unsuitable":1285,"masked":{"WATER":80,"BUILT":155,"SEA":1023},"noData":0},"variation":{"classShares":{"HIGH":0.244,"MODERATE":0.221,"LOW":0.534},"usefulVariation":true},"confidenceComponents":[{"component":"range evidence","holds":true,"detail":"1814 records in 89 squares (needs 300 in 30)"},{"component":"habitat concordance","holds":true,"detail":"record squares on moderate-or-better land 45 in 100 against 40 in 100 across the range (ratio 1.11; needs 1)"},{"component":"seasonal applicability","holds":true,"detail":"all-year records for a species that stays"},{"component":"source age","holds":true,"detail":"records read 2026-09-30; land cover epoch 20